        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Ses talents de guérisseur sont tels que les marins l’emportent quand ils embarquent pour une longue traversée.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Fishermen take them along on long voyages, because if you have an Alomomola with you, there’ll be no need for a doctor or medicine.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "漁師は　長い　航海の　とき 連れていく。　ママンボウが　いれば 医者も　薬も　いらないからだ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "よわった　ポケモンを　たすけるのは それを　ねらう　ポケモンに じぶんも　おそわれるから　らしい。",
